window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>I was sold to him to settle a debt... but Dante Bellanti never settles.</i></p> <p>My father was always a gambling man.<br> Unfortunately, he never could pick winners.<br> When the wolves closed in, he chose himself, like always.</p> <p>He traded his freedom... for mine.</p> <p>He forced me to marry.<br> Now Dante Bellanti owns my body.<br> I'm just another possession for a man who already has too much.<br> So I won't let him have my heart.</p> <p>But you know what they say about gambling.</p> <p>The house always wins.</p> <p>And I'm at the mercy of the Bellantis...</p> <p><b>All three books of the Broken Bride Series in one bundle.</b></p>"; 
